<Base title="Pumplog">
  <h1>Pumplog</h1>
  <p>
    Pumplog is a fuel and mileage log for iPhone. Scan the pump receipt, confirm the odometer, and
    Pumplog shows your real fuel consumption, what the car costs you per mile or kilometer and per
    month, and how the price at the pump moves. It reminds you before the oil change or the
    insurance renewal. Miles or kilometers, gallons or liters, any currency, in English, French or
    Arabic. Everything stays on your iPhone: no account, no internet connection needed.
  </p>
  <p>
    The free version scans 8 receipts a month, keeps one vehicle and one active reminder, and shows
    ads. Pumplog Pro, a one-time purchase, removes the limits and the ads and adds CSV and PDF export.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6819197841">Pumplog on the App Store</a> (coming soon)</li>
    <li><a href="https://elmehdimotaqi-ui.github.io/pumplog-privacy/support/">Support</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://elmehdimotaqi-ui.github.io/pumplog-privacy/">Privacy policy</a></li>
  </ul>
</Base>
